<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK TO OPEN LITHUANIA BROKERAGE UNIT.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK TO OPEN LITHUANIA BROKERAGE UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's largest bank, Hansapank, said on Tuesday it will open a Lithuanian brokerage operation in the first half of this year.</p>
<p>Bank officials told Reuters the subsidiary would trade stocks and money market instruments when it opened in Vilnius.</p>
<p>The official did not have an exact date for when operations would be launched.</p>
<p>The bank already has brokerage operations in Estonia and Latvia.</p>
<p>-- Simon Haydon, Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 or reuters@reuter.ee</p>
